WEBVTT

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.850
OHMA TOKITA, FIGHTER
YAMASHITA CORP.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>It was really fun, Ohma Tokita.</i>

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.070
DR. HAJIME HANAFUSA

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.730
There's no way he'll survive this.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.860
<i>In the end,</i>
<i>his heart will reach its limit.</i>

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.370
<i>Ohma's going...</i>

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.580
KAZUO YAMASHITA
PRESIDENT - YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:39.990
<i>...to die?</i>

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:19.930
"FATHER"

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:22.930
MASAHIKO OHTA
PRES. OF UNDER MOUNT, INC.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.430
Ohma...

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:26.430
KAEDE AKIYAMA

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.440
AGITO KANOH REP. FIGHTER
DAINIPPON BANK

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.440
This isn't happening, right? Ohma...

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:36.990
SETSUNA KIRYU

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.740
Stand back up now. Come on.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.790
God cannot be defeated!

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.580
Stand up! Ohma Tokita!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.500
No...

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.130
It can't be. Ohma...

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.170
Ohma...

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.300
-Th-- That's--
-Hey, piggy!

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.390
Huh?

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:02.970
If you end the game, I'll kill you.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.560
You're quite a guy.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.720
RAIAN KURE

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.180
I actually mean it.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:13.020
This might be the most fun I've ever had.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:14.940
Get up!

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:19.110
I'll give you the respect you deserve
and kill you with all I've got!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:20.900
Ohma!

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:25.990
Please, I'm begging you, don't die!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:31.000
This is all because I asked you to win.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.380
Ohma is... Damn it!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.340
I knew it. You went and used the Advance.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.260
<i>Niko...?</i>

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.100
I told you it'd end up like this.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.600
<i>Your Niko Style is no good.</i>

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.430
NIKO TOKITA - OHMA'S MASTER
NIKO STYLE

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:51.890
<i>Get lost.</i>

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:54.270
Is that your excuse?

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:58.110
As I told you,
Niko Style is the best of all.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:00.360
<i>What do you mean, "the best"?</i>

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.240
<i>If it were the best,</i>

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:06.320
<i>you wouldn't have been killed.</i>

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.540
<i>I believed in you.</i>

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.460
<i>If it can't even beat my opponent,</i>

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.130
<i>I have no use for it.</i>

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:22.170
So, you're saying that's why
you used the forbidden move?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.970
Listen, you should become stronger

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.600
with your own strength,
not by using something like that.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.850
<i>That's not enough!</i>

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.690
You dummy.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.810
That's why you should use
your inner tactics.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:45.320
Inner tactics are...
your own personal way of life.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:51.240
You struggle, strive, hurt,
and receive help.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:55.460
All of that piles up
and makes you strong.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.590
Ohma!

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:04.050
You've always overcome
whatever hardships we faced!

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:08.800
No matter the situation,
you've always stood back up,

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.600
and you've always won!

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:15.060
<i>I'm just a stagnating businessman,</i>

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:18.690
<i>but you gave me my hunger back!</i>

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:23.240
<i>You reminded me that I'm a man!</i>

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:28.530
To me, you're a hero.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.330
So... stand up!

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.790
Get on your feet...

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:38.040
Ohma Tokita!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.290
Tsk...

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:45.300
You're so loud, Kazuo Yamashita.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:47.430
ERIO KURE

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:53.520
Tokita is attempting to stand up!

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.930
JERRY TYSON - SAYAKA KATAHARA

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.440
-Stand up!
-Go, Ohma!

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.290
-Tokita!
-Ohma!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.690
That's better.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.610
Otherwise, it would've been boring.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:11.740
<i>Oh! I can't believe this!</i>

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:15.330
<i>Tokita has stood up!</i>

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:20.580
Hey. Do you still have the power
to live up to the expectations?

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.050
It's time for the climax...

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.220
Ohma Tokita!

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.300
<i>Thanks, Kazuo Yamashita.</i>

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.720
<i>Now watch closely, Niko.</i>

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.810
<i>These are my inner tactics!</i>

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.520
ADAMANTINE & FLAME KATA:
FLASHING STEEL - BLAST

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.570
<i>Listen, Ohma.</i>

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:48.820
<i>Flashing Steel is best used as a counter.</i>

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:51.570
<i>Using your opponent's speed</i>
<i>against them...</i>

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.540
<i>will increase your destructive force</i>
<i>exponentially.</i>

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:58.410
<i>That's pretty important.</i>

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.710
<i>You better not forget it!</i>

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:09.050
<i>Oh, and don't forget this one either.</i>

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:13.510
<i>It'd be wasteful</i>
<i>to just stop at one technique.</i>

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.760
Ohma, follow it up!

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.020
IRONBREAKER

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:23.060
WATER KATA: GUILLOTINE

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:33.490
Ah! Raian hurled him away
with the strength of his neck?

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.790
FLASHING STEEL - SMASH

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.960
<i>If you only attack in a fixed pattern,</i>
<i>your moves will be read by your opponent.</i>

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.710
Hot and cold, give him some variation!

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.970
REDIRECTION KATA: WEEPING WILLOW

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.850
WATER KATA: SCREW CUTTER JIZO

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:09.320
<i>What's with these techniques?</i>

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.450
<i>He wasn't doing anything like that before.</i>

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.030
This is my...

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.620
That's right, it's not mine.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.750
It's the proof that you've lived
to this day.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.580
It's your very own Niko Style.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:30.130
The Niko Style is out of my hands now.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:34.010
From now on, you'll be the one
to develop the Niko Style.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:37.800
I believe you can do it.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.600
Goodbye, Ohma.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.890
Ohma!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:48.730
This is...

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.480
my Niko Style!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:58.240
Ohma! Raian can't use Release anymore!

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:03.250
Given what I know of his personality,
he wouldn't ease up on finishing you off,

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.710
yet Raian broke his Release.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.840
Just because he unleashes
his latent strength,

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.130
that doesn't necessarily mean
his stamina improves.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.800
After coming under so many
head-on attacks from you,

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:19.550
Raian doesn't have the strength left
to maintain his Release.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:22.640
He's on the ropes as much as you are!

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.930
You can do this, Ohma!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:31.900
<i>So, that bastard noticed.</i>

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:35.070
<i>Guess he's not so incompetent after all.</i>

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.070
What are you doing, Raian?

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.200
NAOYA OHKUBO

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.870
-Raian's in just as bad shape as you are!
-You're almost there!

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.870
Tokita!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:47.120
Ohma! You've got this!

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:50.710
Now!

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.300
IRONBREAKER

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:58.050
<i>This is the blow he'd been waiting for!</i>

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:02.560
<i>His neck is damaged</i>
<i>from his successive attacks.</i>

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:08.230
<i>Raian lost consciousness</i>
<i>for a duration of 0.14 seconds.</i>

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.690
<i>Everything hangs on this moment.</i>

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:16.070
<i>This is Ohma Tokita's</i>
<i>one and only chance at victory!</i>

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:19.990
Go! Ohma!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.830
ADAMANTINE & WATER KATA:

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:29.620
IRONBREAKER - REVOLUTION

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:48.560
Stop! Stop, Tokita!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.490
We have a winner!

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:11.080
The winner is Ohma Tokita!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.930
Ohma!

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.190
Good stuff, Tokita!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.280
Ah, Ohma!

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:46.580
Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:50.830
You've got serious wounds!
Just stay put for now!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.000
-Kazuo Yamashita...
-Huh?

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.130
You should be worrying about
contacting your son.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:02.180
Well, yeah, I know, but...

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:05.680
Hey, wait! Ohma!

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.230
Ohma.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:26.990
<i>I see.</i>

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:31.120
<i>So, you're the inheritor of Niko.</i>

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.090
GENSAI KUROKI

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:40.340
<i>You found yourself a fine disciple...</i>

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.170
<i>Niko.</i>

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.680
<i>This isn't right!</i>

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:51.220
<i>The real you is a god</i>
<i>who destroys everything!</i>

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.850
<i>You're a tyrannical, cruel savior</i>

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:58.230
<i>that will kill me without remorse.</i>

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:04.650
<i>So why do you cling</i>
<i>to that man's techniques?</i>

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.780
<i>Why won't you just forget him?</i>

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.910
<i>Give it up, kiddo.</i>

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.330
<i>He's my pupil.</i>

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:17.710
<i>I won't let him become some god of yours.</i>

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:22.340
<i>Salvation isn't something</i>
<i>you get from someone else.</i>

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:25.220
<i>It's something you take on your own.</i>

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.640
<i>Niko Tokita!</i>

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:34.100
<i>Why do you always have to get in my way?</i>

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.860
What's the meaning of this?

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.860
I'd like you to hear my apology.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:51.580
I cannot forgive
what your group did this time.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:57.420
<i>But my son Kenzo does share</i>
<i>some of the blame.</i>

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:04.380
It's only natural you would take offense
for him to test you

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.260
while hiding behind someone else.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:08.630
Whatever.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.220
Your apology serves me no purpose.

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:21.020
Do you expect to wipe the slate clean
simply by bowing your head?

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.530
You are so annoying. Leave my sight now.

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:28.450
It would be best not to anger me.

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:31.620
It's true that you have won the match.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:36.200
But if the mood strikes me,

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:39.500
I could easily nullify my promise to you.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:44.670
Be aware that your fate lies
in the palm of my hand.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:48.970
You couldn't do that.

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:54.180
If you do, the Kure family will be ruined.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.180
What did you say?

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:05.570
The Kure family is an assassin group
that does jobs on commission, isn't it?

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:10.740
You strictly abide by your contracts
to maintain trust...

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.950
just as businessmen like us do.

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.490
Huh?

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:19.620
If you, as the patriarch,
went back on your word

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:24.880
to commit a killing for a personal grudge,
I wonder what would happen?

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:29.300
You brat. Are you trying to threaten me?

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.510
Are you a fool?

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:38.060
I can have you eliminated right here,
without anyone's being the wiser.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:41.940
No. That would be impossible.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:47.570
Because I've just obtained
the proof I need.

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:51.530
I recently upgraded to a smart phone.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.280
RECORDING

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:58.370
It's very convenient. You can record data
and automatically upload it.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:02.170
The upload destination is
the Nogi Group's classified server.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.170
It can't be wiped so easily.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:09.510
Do you not value your life?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:14.640
You want to put your life at risk
to save your worthless son?

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:19.430
Damn right I do! Kenzo is my son!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:23.640
And not just Kenzo,
but also Ohma and the others!

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:28.860
I won't let any harm come to them,
no matter who I have to stand up to!

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:31.820
Go ahead, just try me.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:37.580
Whether it's the Kure family
or anyone else, I'll crush them!

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.700
I see...

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:43.960
that your knees are telling
a different story from your mouth.

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.920
Huh? I-- It's not what you think!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:52.630
I'm just trembling with passion,
not because I'm scared.

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.470
Oh, forget it.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:58.260
Toying with you has lost its fun.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.810
A promise is a promise.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:07.940
I recalled the assassination order
on Kenzo Yamashita a while ago.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.940
Hey, it's cancelled.

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.610
We're pulling out.

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.450
What, so Raian lost?

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:20.950
Shit! I'm running late
for my next appointment.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.290
I'll give you a ride to your client.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.210
Oh, thanks.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.460
KENZO YAMASHITA

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.040
Hey, buddy,
you'd better thank your old man.

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.590
Are we still doing the killing?

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:36.300
Grandpa,
the killing is all done, remember?

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:39.010
My old man?

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:43.100
By the time you dropped in,

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:46.940
I'd already rescinded the order.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:50.400
But then you were giving me
such a good show,

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.730
I thought I'd play with you for a bit.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.610
<i>D-- Damn hustler!</i>

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.700
Come on, I kept my promise.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.200
Begone now.

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:07.580
You're not going to stab me in the back
or anything when I turn to leave, are you?

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.420
I won't, so just leave now!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.800
What happened to all that bravado?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:16.670
Ah, well... I'll be off then.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.810
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:28.020
<i>His appearance, wit and ability</i>
<i>are nothing like yours, and yet...</i>

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:32.770
<i>for a moment, that man</i>
<i>reminded me of you, Metsudo.</i>

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:35.280
METSUDO KATAHARA
KENGAN ASSOCIATION'S CHAIRMAN

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:39.030
Ohma Tokita, huh?

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:42.990
It's truly amazing
that he defeated Raian Kure.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.410
I'd call it the upset of the tournament.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.580
As far as I remember,

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:52.170
Yamashita Corporation is
a subsidiary of yours, right? Nogi.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.170
HIDEKI NOGI
NOGI GROUP'S CHAIRMAN

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:58.470
Yes. I established the company this year
as a part of my subsidiary strategy.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:00.590
I see.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:05.720
Everyone is coming up with
all sorts of plots to challenge me.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:10.390
I hope you'll continue to entertain me.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.190
<i>I've finally come this far.</i>

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:20.570
<i>Metsudo Katahara...</i>
<i>Your ruling ends here.</i>

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:25.790
<i>I'll revolutionize the Kengan Association</i>
<i>with my own hands.</i>

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.080
We lost.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.870
REICHI KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:34.630
The Kure family hasn't lost
in a kengan match since Grandpa's time.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.300
Yes. With this,
we have a total of four losses.

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.840
HORIO KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.800
So, Raian lost...

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:48.350
I detest him, but I had accepted
his strength to be truly unique.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.270
It's the arrogance of youth.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:57.110
Don't hold it against him too much.
I had a similar time in my life.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.990
Raian will keep growing stronger.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.280
HOLLIS KURE
KURE FAMILY

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:07.370
-What are you doing, Karura?
-Hah! Ohma beat Raian!

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.790
That makes Ohma my husband!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.120
Let's make a baby right now, Ohma!

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:15.710
Put your clothes back on.
It's immodest.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.380
-Give me your seed!
-Who does she take after?

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:23.090
Though, now that he's defeated Raian,

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:27.560
the thought of him marrying into
our family is becoming more likely.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.060
Of course, it depends on his will as well.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.940
But I'm sure Grandfather is unsettled
at the mere thought.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:37.860
Karura is another matter entirely!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.820
They'll never get my blessing!

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.900
DAD
ANSWER/REJECT

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.540
Hello? Kenzo! Is this Kenzo?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.670
Yes, Dad.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:02.090
It's been a while
since the last time we talked.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:07.510
Are you all right? You are, right?
No, that can wait.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.640
I was in the wrong.

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:13.310
Let's have a long chat
when I get back. Okay?

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.400
Dad, huh?

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:20.020
-There you are.
-Huh?

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:21.780
What are you doing here?

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:25.700
Ohma, you should stay put
in the doctor's room as I told you.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.200
I'm fine, this is nothing.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.990
That's simply not true.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:33.950
The way you fight...
Do you know how worried I was?

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:37.460
Oh? Since when have you become
a lady who says such sweet things?

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:39.710
Ohma!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.130
Thank you so much for saving my son!

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:49.010
I'm so glad you're okay, too!

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:52.430
A man shouldn't cry.

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:55.020
Come on, let's go get some food...

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.350
Kazuo Yamashita.

00:21:57.940 --> 00:21:59.860
Yeah, sure!

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:03.780
What are you doing? You're injured!

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:06.450
My blood's feeling thin.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:09.030
In that case, you should
head straight back to the infirmary!

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:10.280
I'm hungry.

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:18.830
KENGAN LIFE-OR-DEATH

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:20.380
<i>The Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament.</i>

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:23.880
<i>It represents the hidden, dark side</i>
<i>of the Japanese economy.</i>

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:29.010
<i>Entrants vie for the ultimate position</i>
<i>of authority, Kengan Association Chairman.</i>

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:33.720
<i>It's a battle to determine</i>
<i>Japan's strongest corporation and fighter.</i>

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:38.980
<i>Thirty-two corporations and</i>
<i>fighters aim for the top!</i>

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:42.400
<i>Who is the strongest?</i>

00:24:18.950 --> 00:24:20.960
Subtitle translation by Miki Miyaji
